{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/136effabc9eebf52310fd5c804600b91.poster.avif?t=1770153853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/136effabc9eebf52310fd5c804600b91.webm?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/136effabc9eebf52310fd5c804600b91.mp4?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your Only Weapon Is a Phone, Your Only Ally Is a Mystery.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You wake up in the labyrinthine facilities of Cerberus Corporation. In your hand, <i>a cellphone</i>\u2014and cryptic messages from an anonymous figure calling themselves &quot;The Savior.&quot; You <i>have</i> to trust their instructions: They might open doors in the labyrinth\u2026 or lead you into deadly traps. <strong>Help or a threat?</strong> You won\u2019t know until it\u2019s too late. Your phone is your <i>flashlight</i>, your <i>hacking tool</i>, and your <i>distraction device</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/9ddbeaa12f9b29c6a1b9140057d88117.poster.avif?t=1770153853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/9ddbeaa12f9b29c6a1b9140057d88117.webm?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/9ddbeaa12f9b29c6a1b9140057d88117.mp4?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gather Evidence, Unravel Secrets:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Notes scrawled on walls hint at the company\u2019s &quot;innocent&quot; operations. Old newspapers and encrypted files whisper of Cerberus\u2019 <i>dark trade</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can You Trust The Savior?</strong> The voice behind the messages\u2026 <i>A fellow victim, or part of Cerberus\u2019 game?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Remember:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every step you take is watched. The cameras don\u2019t see you\u2026 but <i>people</i> do. Hide. Deceive. Escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>\u201cYour escape might be a beginning. But it\u2019s not the end Cerberus has planned for you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/c81f175e1d2515403b22c3405a302dfa.poster.avif?t=1770153853\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/c81f175e1d2515403b22c3405a302dfa.webm?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547720/extras/c81f175e1d2515403b22c3405a302dfa.mp4?t=1770153853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547720?t=1770153853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.ste